      "case_id": "answer-f-string-pi",
      "expected_status": "answered",
      "observed_status": "answered",
      "correct": true,
      "answer": {
        "schema_version": "1",
        "question": "Python 3.14 的 f 字符串怎样嵌入表达式并把 pi 格式化到小数点后三位？",
        "status": "answered",
        "answer": "在 Python 3.14 中，可以使用 f-字符串嵌入表达式并格式化 `math.pi` 到小数点后三位，语法为：`f'The value of pi is approximately {math.pi:.3f}.'`。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "rank": 1,
            "chunk_id": "a6b404ac-ade9-5509-af0d-0175f9d10330",
            "python_version": "3.14",
            "documentation_release": "3.14.6",
            "section_path": [
              "7. 输入与输出",
              "7.1. 更复杂的输出格式",
              "7.1.1. 格式化字符串字面值"
            ],
            "citation_url": "https://docs.python.org/zh-cn/3.14/tutorial/inputoutput.html#formatted-string-literals",
            "excerpt": "格式化字符串字面值 （简称为 f-字符串）在字符串前加前缀 f 或 F，通过 {expression} 表达式，把 Python 表达式的值添加到字符串内。\n\n格式说明符是可选的，写在表达式后面，可以更好地控制格式化值的方式。下例将 pi 舍入到小数点后三位：\n\n>>> import math\n>>> print(f'The value of pi is approximately {math.pi:.3f}.')\nThe value of pi is approximately 3.142.\n\n\n在 ':' 后传递整数，为该字段设置最小字符宽度，常用于列对齐：\n\n>>> table = {'Sjoerd': 4127, 'Jack': 4098, 'Dcab': 7678}\n>>> for name, phone in table.items():\n...     print(f'{name:10} ==> {phone:10d}')\n...\nSjoerd     ==>       4127\nJack       ==>       4098\nDcab       ==>       7678\n"
          }
        ],
